{"id":"3f6e727d451fa23c","group":"90","path":"90/90-ex-russell-paradox-set.md","title":"Russell Paradox Set Example","display":"ex-russell-paradox-set — Russell Paradox Set Example","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-ex-russell-paradox-set","aliases":["90-ex-russell-paradox-set"],"display":"ex-russell-paradox-set — Russell Paradox Set Example","depends_on":["[[90-df-russell-paradox]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-ex-russell-paradox-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-ex-russell-paradox-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-russell-paradox-set — Russell Paradox Set Example"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bbac61b28f38b09f\" href=\"?note=bbac61b28f38b09f\" title=\"90-df-russell-paradox\">90-df-russell-paradox</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> (candidate set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Russell}(R)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\,(x\\in R\\leftrightarrow x\\notin x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Russell}(R)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\,(x\\in R\\leftrightarrow x\\notin x)\\)</span> (unrestricted Russell comprehension)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}russell\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}set}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Russell}(R)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(R\\in R\\leftrightarrow R\\notin R\\bigr),\n\\qquad\n\\neg\\exists R\\;\\mathrm{Russell}(R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}russell\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}set}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Russell}(R)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(R\\in R\\leftrightarrow R\\notin R\\bigr),\n\\qquad\n\\neg\\exists R\\;\\mathrm{Russell}(R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=R\">\\(x=R\\)</span> 代入无限制概括式便得到矛盾；结论是否定这种概括产生的集合存在。</li>\n<li>ZFC 的分离公理限制在既有集合内，因此不能形成这个“所有集合”的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-russell-paradox","status":"resolved","id":"bbac61b28f38b09f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-russell-paradox]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Russell}(R)\\leftrightarrow\\forall x\\,(x\\in R\\leftrightarrow x\\notin x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}russell\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}set}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Russell}(R)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(R\\in R\\leftrightarrow R\\notin R\\bigr),\n\\qquad\n\\neg\\exists R\\;\\mathrm{Russell}(R).","display":true},{"tex":"x=R","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":932,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-162","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-ex-berry-paradox-formal.md]]\n[[90-ex-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-ex-diagonalization-method.md]]\n[[90-ex-godel-sentence-construction.md]]\n[[90-ex-quine-construction.md]]\n[[90-ex-quine-sentence.md]]\n[[90-ex-rosser-sentence-construction.md]]\n[[90-ex-russell-paradox-set.md]]\n[[90-ex-self-reference-program.md]]"}],"outgoing":["bbac61b28f38b09f"]}